#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Migration from 4.3 to 5.1"
msgstr ""

#.  container host = new server = new server machine with the {productname} {productnumber} Server container(s)
#.  old server = {productname} 4.3 Server
#.  We need to figure out which mlm versions prior to the container release can or should be migrated. Something like any version prior to yyyy.mm and later than.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and considerations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To migrate a SUSE Manager 4.3 Proxy to {productname} {productnumber}, you "
"require a new machine with {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm} and "
"[literal]``mgrpxy`` installed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:4
msgid ""
"An in-place migration from SUSE Manager 4.3 to {productnumber} is not "
"supported, regardless of whether the chosen host operating system is "
"{sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before migrating from SUSE Manager 4.3 to {productnumber}, any existing "
"traditional clients including the traditional proxies must be migrated to "
"{salt}.  For more information about migrating traditional {productname} 4.3 "
"clients to {salt} clients, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Traditional contact protocol is no longer supported in {productname} 5.0 and "
"later."
msgstr "ໂປຣໂຕຄອນການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບເກົ່າ (Traditional contact protocol) ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປໃນ {productname} 5.0 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Before migrating a SUSE Manager 4.3 Proxy to {productname} {productnumber}, "
"the SUSE Manager 4.3 Server needs to be migrated first, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-51.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ບົດນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In {productname} 4.3, the proxy can be deployed using three different "
"methods:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:10
msgid "RPM based"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:11
msgid "containerized running on Podman"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:12
msgid "containerized running on k3s"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In {productname} {productnumber}, RPM based support was removed, and only "
"the containerized version running with podman or k3s is supported.  "
"Furthermore, the management of the containerized proxy running with Podman "
"was re-designed and made simpler with the [command]``mgrpxy`` tool."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy a new {productname} {productnumber} proxy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Because an in-place migration is not supported, a deployment of a new "
"{productname} proxy with a new FQDN is required.  For more information on "
"deploying a new proxy on {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm} see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[] ."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate clients to the new proxy"
msgstr ""

