#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Before migrating the clients, ensure that the new {productname} "
"{productnumber} Proxy is already deployed and fully functional."
msgstr ""

