#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating clients from the old to the new proxy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "Log in to the {productname} Server {webui}."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} Server {webui}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:20
msgid "From the left navigation, select menu:Systems[Systems List]."
msgstr "ຈາກແຖບເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Systems[Systems List]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:21
msgid "Navigate to the old 4.3 proxy page, and click the [guimenu]``Proxy`` tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ proxy 4.3 ເກົ່າ, ແລະ ຄລິກແຖບ [guimenu]``Proxy``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:22
msgid "Select all systems to \"SSM\"."
msgstr "ເລືອກທຸກລະບົບໄປທີ່ \"SSM\"."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:23
msgid "From the left navigation, select menu:Systems[System Set Manager]."
msgstr "ຈາກແຖບເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Systems[System Set Manager]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:24
msgid "Select the sub-menu menu:Misc[Proxy]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເມນູຍ່ອຍ menu:Misc[Proxy]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:25
msgid "From the drop-down select the new proxy to migrate to."
msgstr "ຈາກ Drop-down, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ proxy ໃໝ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Change Proxy]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Change Proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:27
msgid ""
"All selected clients will now be migrated to the new proxy.  You can check "
"the schedule progress to verify if all clients were successfully migrated."
msgstr "ໄຄລແອນທີ່ເລືອກທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຫາ proxy ໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງແຜນວຽກ (Schedule) ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າໄຄລແອນທັງໝົດໄດ້ຖືກຍ້າຍຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:28
msgid ""
"After a few minutes, the clients will start to show the new connection "
"path.  When all clients have the connection path under the new proxy, the "
"old SUSE Manager 4.3 Proxy system is not needed anymore and can be removed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "TFTP files synchronization"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄຟລ໌ TFTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Containerized proxies do not use tftpsync mechanism to transfer tftproot "
"files.  Instead these files are transparently downloaded and cached on "
"demand."
msgstr "Containerized proxies ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ກົນໄກ tftpsync ເພື່ອໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ tftproot. ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແນວນັ້ນ, ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ເຮັດ cache ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການຮຽກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To prevent false positive errors during [command]``cobbler sync`` run, "
"migrated 4.3 proxies need to be removed from tftpsync mechanism."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບ False positive ໃນລະຫວ່າງການລັນ [command]``cobbler sync``, ບັນດາ proxy 4.3 ທີ່ຍ້າຍມາແລ້ວຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກຖອນອອກຈາກກົນໄກ tftpsync."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:32
msgid ""
"If you previously configured a 4.3 proxy to receive TFTP files, one of the "
"following configuration option is required:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເຄີຍຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy 4.3 ເພື່ອຮັບໄຟລ໌ TFTP ມາກ່ອນ, ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:33
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:86
msgid "To get to a shell inside the container, run on the container host:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາ Shell ພາຍໃນ container, ໃຫ້ລັນໃນເຄື່ອງ container host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:34
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {productnumber} server container, run "
"[command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` with the list of remaining 4.3 proxies as "
"arguments.  If no 4.3 proxies remain, run [command]``configure-tftpsync.sh`` "
"with no arguments."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-43-51.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {productnumber} server container, manually remove the "
"relevant proxy from the [option]``proxies`` setting in the "
"[path]``/etc/cobbler/settings.yaml`` file.  If there are no 4.3 proxies "
"remaining, then manually remove the [option]``proxies`` list completely."
msgstr ""

