#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This guide only covers the migration from {productname} 4.3 to "
"{productnumber}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Migrating an existing {productname} {productnumber} instance to the same "
"version while switching the host operating system from {sl-micro} "
"{microversion} to {sles} {bci-mlm}, or vice versa, is not handled by the "
"[command]``mgradm migrate`` command."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hostnames"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Current migration procedure does not include functionality for renaming "
"hostnames.  As a result, fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the new "
"server will remain the same as that of the old server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The IP address must remain unchanged to ensure that the clients can contact "
"the server."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:13
msgid ""
"After the migration, it is necessary to manually update the DHCP and DNS "
"records to point to the new server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG keys"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:15
msgid "Self-trusted GPG keys are not migrated."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:16
msgid ""
"GPG keys that are trusted in the RPM database only are not migrated.  Thus, "
"synchronizing channels with [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` can fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The administrator must migrate these keys manually from the 4.3 installation "
"to the container host after the actual server migration."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕ້ອງຍ້າຍກະແຈເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນ 4.3 ໄປຫາຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍເຊີເວີຕົວຈິງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Manual migration of the 4.3 GPG keys to the new server"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:19
msgid "Copy the keys from the 4.3 server to the container host of the new server."
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ກະແຈຈາກເຊີເວີ 4.3 ໄປຫາຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສຂອງເຊີເວີໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Later, add each key to the migrated server with the command "
"[command]``mgradm gpg add <PATH_TO_KEY_FILE>``."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມແຕ່ລະກະແຈເຂົ້າໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ຍ້າຍມາແລ້ວດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm gpg add <PATH_TO_KEY_FILE>``."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL certificates"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:22
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-51.adoc:4
msgid ""
"During a migration the server SSL certificate and CA chain are copied from "
"the source server, meaning that only the database certificates are required"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (Migration)"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {productname} {productnumber} server host"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Do not pre-install {productname} on the prepared {sl-micro} {microversion} "
"or {sles} {bci-mlm} system."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The migration process is designed to perform the server installation "
"automatically.  Running [command]``mgradm install`` and then "
"[command]``mgradm migrate`` is not supported and will lead to an unsupported "
"system state."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the following steps, we are only preparing the host system, not "
"installing the actual {productname} {productnumber} Server."
msgstr "ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ກຽມລະບົບໂຮສເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname} {productnumber} ຕົວຈິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can use VM images based on {sl-micro} {microversion} as a migration "
"target.  In such a scenario, you can prepare the host system as described in"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:29
msgid "xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc[]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:30
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:74
msgid "or"
msgstr "ຫຼື"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:31
msgid "xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:32
msgid ""
"However, at the end the last step is executing the command [command]``mgradm "
"migrate <FQDN>`` instead of [command]``mgradm install <FQDN>``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH connection preparation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:34
msgid ""
"This step ensures that the new {productname} {productnumber} Server can "
"connect to the existing 4.3 Server over SSH without requiring a password.  "
"It involves generating and configuring SSH keys, setting up an SSH agent, "
"and copying the public key to the old server.  This setup is required for "
"the migration process to run without manual intervention."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:35
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing the SSH connection"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Ensure that for [systemitem]``root`` an SSH key exists on the new "
"{productnumber} server.  If a key does not exist, create it with:"
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນວ່າສຳລັບ [systemitem]``root`` ມີກະແຈ SSH ຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productnumber} ໃໝ່ແລ້ວ. ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ມີກະແຈ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:37
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -t rsa\n"
msgstr "ssh-keygen -t rsa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The SSH configuration and agent should be ready on the new server for a "
"connection to the 4.3 server that does not prompt for a password."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH ແລະ agent ຄວນຈະພ້ອມຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ 4.3 ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຖາມຫາລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:39
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "eval $(ssh-agent); ssh-add\n"
msgstr "eval $(ssh-agent); ssh-add\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:40
msgid ""
"To establish a connection that does not prompt for a password, the migration "
"script relies on an SSH agent running on the new server.  If the agent is "
"not active yet, initiate it by running [command]``eval $(ssh-agent)``.  Then "
"add the SSH key to the running agent with [command]``ssh-add`` followed by "
"the path to the private key.  You will be prompted to enter the password for "
"the private key during this process."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຖາມຫາລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ສະຄຣິບການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈະອາໄສ SSH agent ທີ່ຣັນຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີໃໝ່. ຫາກ agent ຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການຣັນ [command]``eval $(ssh-agent)``. ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມກະແຈ SSH ເຂົ້າໃນ agent ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ [command]``ssh-add`` ຕາມດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາ private key. ທ່ານຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ private key ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Copy the public SSH key to the {productname} 4.3 Server "
"([literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>``) with [command]``ssh-copy-id``.  Replace "
"[literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` with the FQDN of the 4.3 server:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ public SSH key ໄປຫາເຊີເວີ {productname} 4.3 ([literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>``) ດ້ວຍ [command]``ssh-copy-id``. ແທນບ່ອນ [literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` ດ້ວຍ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ 4.3:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-copy-id <old server.fqdn>\n"
msgstr "ssh-copy-id <old server.fqdn>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:43
msgid ""
"The SSH key will be copied into the old server's "
"[path]``~/.ssh/authorized_keys`` file.  For more information, see the "
"[literal]``ssh-copy-id`` manpage."
msgstr "ກະແຈ SSH ຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``~/.ssh/authorized_keys`` ຂອງເຊີເວີເກົ່າ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ manpage ຂອງ [literal]``ssh-copy-id``."

#.  . This step is optional:
#.    The migration script only uses the 4.3 server's FQDN in the SSH command.
#.    This means that every other configuration required to connect, needs to be defined in the [path]``~/.ssh/config`` file.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Establish an SSH connection from the new server to the old {productname} "
"Server to check that no password is needed.  Also there must not by any "
"problem with the host fingerprint.  In case of trouble, remove old "
"fingerprints from the [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` file.  Then try again.  "
"The fingerprint will be stored in the local [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` "
"file."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈາກເຊີເວີໃໝ່ຫາເຊີເວີ {productname} ເກົ່າເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີບັນຫາກັບ fingerprint ຂອງໂຮສ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ລົບ fingerprints ເກົ່າອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ. fingerprint ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` ຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform the migration"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:46
msgid ""
"When planning your migration from SUSE Manager 4.3 to {productname} "
"{productnumber}, ensure that your target instance meets or exceeds the "
"specifications of the old setup."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:47
msgid ""
"This includes, but is not limited to, memory (RAM), CPU Cores, Storage, and "
"Network Bandwidth."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມເຖິງ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຈຳກັດພຽງແຕ່, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (RAM), ຄໍຂອງຊີພີຢູ (CPU Cores), ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຊ່ອງສັນຍານເຄືອຂ່າຍ (Network Bandwidth)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When migrating from SUSE Manager 4.3, you will be prompted for the "
"[guimenu]``Password for the CA key to generate``.  It is essential to enter "
"the same CA password that was used in your SUSE Manager 4.3 installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Entering the wrong password will result in a failure to generate the "
"database certificate and will cause the migration to abort with the "
"following error:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Error: cannot configure db container: Cannot generate database certificate: "
"CA validation failed!\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Make sure the correct CA password is available before starting the migration "
"process."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing the migration"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:53
msgid ""
"This step is optional.  If custom persistent storage is required for your "
"infrastructure, use the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` tool.  For more "
"information about [command]``mgr-storage-server``, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ຫາກໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄົງທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-storage-server``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [command]``mgr-storage-server``, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Execute the following command to migrate and set up a new {productname} "
"{productnumber} server.  Replace [literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` with the FQDN "
"of the 4.3 server:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Make sure to upgrade your 4.3 server and apply all available updates before "
"starting the migration process.  Additionally, remove any unnecessary "
"channels to help reduce the overall migration time."
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນວ່າໄດ້ອັບເກຣດເຊີເວີ 4.3 ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກການອັບເດດທີ່ມີຢູ່ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມຂະບວນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ໃຫ້ລົບຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອອກ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເວລາໃນການຍ້າຍລະບົບໂດຍລວມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:56
msgid ""
"The migration can take a very long time depending on the amount of data that "
"needs to be replicated.  To reduce downtime it is possible to run the "
"migration multiple times in a process of _initial replication_, "
"_re-replication_, or _final replication and switch over_ while all the "
"services on the old 4.3 server can stay up and running."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Only during the final migration, the processes on the old 4.3 server need to "
"be stopped."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-43-51.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For all non-final replications add the parameter [command]``--prepare`` to "
"prevent the automatic stopping of services on the old 4.3 server."
msgstr ""

