msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy ແບບແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped)"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is air-gapped deployment?"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແບບແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped) ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Air-gapped deployment refers to the setup and operation of any networked "
"system that is physically isolated from insecure networks, especially the "
"internet.  This type of deployment is commonly used in high-security "
"environments such as military installations, financial systems, critical "
"infrastructure, and anywhere sensitive data is handled and must be protected "
"from external threats."
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແບບແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped) ໝາຍເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລະບົບເຄືອຂ່າຍໃດໜຶ່ງ ທີ່ຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພທາງກາຍະພາບ, ໂດຍສະເພາະອິນເຕີເນັດ. ການນຳໃຊ້ປະເພດນີ້ມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພສູງ ເຊັ່ນ: ສະຖານທີ່ທາງການທະຫານ, ລະບົບການເງິນ, ໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຳຄັນ ແລະ ບ່ອນໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມີການຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນ ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປົກປ້ອງຈາກໄພຄຸກຄາມພາຍນອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:4
msgid "At the moment, air-gapped deployment is available only on {sl-micro}."
msgstr ""

