#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a Custom Container Image for a Service"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ Custom Container Image ສຳລັບການບໍລິການ (Service)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:59
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} Proxy suite is configured to use the same "
"image version and registry path for each of its services.  However, it is "
"possible to override the default values for a specific service using the "
"install parameters ending with [literal]``-tag`` and [literal]``-image``."
msgstr "ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, {productname} Proxy suite ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ image ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງ registry ດຽວກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ service. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບ service ໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [literal]``-tag`` ແລະ [literal]``-image``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:61
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:40
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:28
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrpxy install podman --httpd-tag 0.1.0 --httpd-image "
"registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-httpd /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy install podman --httpd-tag 0.1.0 --httpd-image registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-httpd /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:62
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:41
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:29
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:110
msgid ""
"It adjusts the configuration file for the httpd service, where "
"[path]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-httpds`` is the image to use and "
"[literal]``0.1.0`` is the version tag, before restarting it."
msgstr "ມັນຈະປັບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ httpd service, ໂດຍທີ່ [path]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-httpds`` ແມ່ນ image ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ແລະ [literal]``0.1.0`` ແມ່ນເວີຊັນແທັກ (Tag), ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່."

