#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the Virtual Machine settings for deployment of "
"{productname} {productnumber} Proxy as an image.  KVM will be combined with "
"Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) as a sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Virtual Machine ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບ Image. KVM ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

