#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:37
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:25
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a Custom Container Image for a Service"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Custom Container Image ສຳລັບ Service"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:38
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:107
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} Proxy suite is set to use the same image "
"version and registry path for each of its services.  However, it is possible "
"to override the default values for a specific service using the install "
"parameters ending with [literal]``-tag`` and [literal]``-image``."
msgstr "ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, {productname} Proxy suite ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ image ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງ registry ດຽວກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ service. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບ service ໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [literal]``-tag`` ແລະ [literal]``-image``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:39
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:27
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:108
msgid "For example, use it like this:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃຊ້ງານຄືແນວນີ້:"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Deployment as a Virtual Machine - VMware"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບ Virtual Machine - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the Virtual Machine settings for deployment of "
"{productname} {productnumber} Proxy as an image.  VMware will be used as a "
"sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Virtual Machine ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບ Image. VMware ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Machine Settings - VMware"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Virtual Machine - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"This section describes VMware configurations, focusing on the creation of an "
"extra virtual disk essential for the {productname} Proxy storage partition "
"within VMware environments."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ VMware, ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ການສ້າງ virtual disk ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ storage partition ຂອງ {productname} Proxy ພາຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ VMware."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This section specifies the minimum requirements.  These are suitable for a "
"quick test installation, such as a proxy with one client."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກຳນົດຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ. ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອທົດສອບແບບໄວ, ເຊັ່ນ proxy ທີ່ມີໄຄລແອນດຽວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the VMware Virtual Machine"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Download {productname} Proxy [filename]``.vmdk`` file then transfer a copy "
"to your VMware storage."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.vmdk`` ຂອງ {productname} Proxy ຈາກນັ້ນໂອນຍ້າຍສຳເນົາໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ VMware ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Make a copy of uploaded [filename]``.vmdk`` file using VMware web "
"interface.  This will convert provided [filename]``.vmdk`` file to the "
"format suitable for vSphere hypervisor."
msgstr "ສ້າງສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.vmdk`` ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດແລ້ວໂດຍໃຊ້ VMware web interface. ນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.vmdk`` ໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບ vSphere hypervisor."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Create and name a new virtual machine based on the Guest OS Family "
"[systemitem]``Linux`` and Guest OS Version {sle} 15 (64-bit)."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນໃໝ່ໂດຍອີງຕາມ Guest OS Family [systemitem]``Linux`` ແລະ Guest OS Version {sle} 15 (64-bit)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:18
msgid "Add an additional [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` of 100 GB (or more)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` ເພີ່ມເຕີມຂະໜາດ 100 GB (ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:18
msgid "Configure RAM and number of CPUs with minimum values. *)"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ RAM ແລະ ຈຳນວນ CPU ຕາມຄ່າຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ. *)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:19
msgid "Set the network adapter as required."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ network adapter ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Power on the VM, and follow firstboot dialogs (keyboard layout, license "
"agreement, time zone, password for root)."
msgstr "ເປີດເຄື່ອງ VM, ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນການບູດຄັ້ງທຳອິດ (ຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມ, ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດ, ເຂດເວລາ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ root)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber}  Proxy Deployment on K3s"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ໃນ K3s"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing K3s"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ K3s"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy is supported on K3s running on top of {sl-micro} in a "
"single node cluster.  If you need to deploy it in any other Kubernetes "
"environment, contact support for evaluation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the container host machine, install [literal]``K3s`` (replace "
"[literal]``<K3S_HOST_FQDN>`` with the FQDN of your K3s host):"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງ container host, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ [literal]``K3s`` (ປ່ຽນ [literal]``<K3S_HOST_FQDN>`` ເປັນ FQDN ຂອງ K3s host ຂອງທ່ານ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | "
"INSTALL_K3S_EXEC=\"--tls-san=<K3S_HOST_FQDN>\" sh -\n"
msgstr "curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | INSTALL_K3S_EXEC=\"--tls-san=<K3S_HOST_FQDN>\" sh -\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing Tools"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມື"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The installation requires the [literal]``mgrpxy`` and [literal]``helm`` "
"packages."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້ຕ້ອງການແພັກເກດ [literal]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ [literal]``helm``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The [literal]``mgrpxy`` and ``helm`` packages are available in the "
"{productname} Proxy product repositories."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ [literal]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ ``helm`` ມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນ repository ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:9
msgid "To install it, run:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update pkg install helm mgrpxy\n"
msgstr "transactional-update pkg install helm mgrpxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:35
msgid "Reboot"
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (Reboot)"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying the {productname} Proxy Helm Chart"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy Helm Chart"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To configure the storage of the volumes to be used by the {productname} "
"Proxy pod, define persistent volumes for the following claims.  If you do "
"not customize the storage configuration, K3s will automatically create the "
"storage volumes for you."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ volumes ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ {productname} Proxy pod, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ persistent volumes ສຳລັບ claims ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເອງ, K3s ຈະສ້າງ storage volumes ໃຫ້ທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid "The persistent volume claims are named:"
msgstr "Persistent volume claims ຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "[literal]``squid-cache-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``squid-cache-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:16
msgid "[literal]``package-cache-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``package-cache-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:17
msgid "[literal]``tftp-boot-pv-claim``"
msgstr "[literal]``tftp-boot-pv-claim``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Create the configuration for the {productname} Proxy as documented in "
