msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບການນຳໃຊ້ສອງຮູບແບບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
