#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Install tools packages and image packages (replace $ARCH$ with the correct "
"architecture)."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ແພັກເກດຮູບພາບ (ປ່ຽນ $ARCH$ ເປັນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ)."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update pkg install mgradm* mgrctl* "
"suse-multi-linux-manager-5.1-$ARCH$-server-*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:19
msgid "Deploy {productname} with [command]``mgradm``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more detailed information about installing {productname} Server on "
"{sl-micro}, see "
"xref:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc[Deploy Server as a "
"Virtual Machine]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "PTFs"
msgstr "PTFs"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The PTF images are not available as packages.  This means that they should "
"be pulled using [command]``podman`` on a machine with internet access, then "
"saved in an archive, transferred to the air-gapped machine and loaded there."
msgstr "PTF images ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກມັນຄວນຖືກດຶງ (Pull) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``podman`` ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີອິນເຕີເນັດ, ຈາກນັ້ນບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ (Archive), ໂອນຍ້າຍໄປຫາເຄື່ອງທີ່ແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped) ແລະ ໂຫຼດຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Pulling the image on a machine with internet access"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຶງ Image ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີອິນເຕີເນັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:25
msgid "Install [command]``podman``."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ [command]``podman``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:26
msgid "Authenticate against the {suse} Registry using the SCC credentials:"
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ {suse} Registry ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SCC:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"set +o history\n"
"echo SCC_MIRRORING_PASSWORD | podman login -u \"SCC_MIRRORING_USER\" "
"--password-stdin registry.suse.com\n"
"set -o history\n"
msgstr ""
"set +o history\n"
"echo SCC_MIRRORING_PASSWORD | podman login -u \"SCC_MIRRORING_USER\" --password-stdin registry.suse.com\n"
"set -o history\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Create a [path]``/tmp/ptf-images`` temporary file with the URL of the PTF "
"images, one per line.  In most of the cases only the server image is needed "
"and it can be created with a command like the following, after replacing the "
"[command]``SCC_USERID`` and [command]``PTFID`` values."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SCC_USERID=aXXXX\n"
"PTFID=12345\n"
"echo "
"\"registry.suse.com/a/$SCC_USERID/$PTFID/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.1/x86_64/server:latest-ptf-$PTFID\" "
">>/tmp/ptf-images\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:30
msgid "Pull each of the container images of the PTF and save them in a tar archive."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for image in `cat /tmp/ptf-images`; do\n"
"    podman pull $image\n"
"done\n"
"podman save -o /tmp/ptf-images.tar `cat /tmp/ptf-images`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Transfer the [path]``/tmp/ptf-images.tar`` images archive on the server to "
"patch."
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍ [path]``/tmp/ptf-images.tar`` ບ່ອນເກັບ images ໄປຍັງເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະລົງແພັດ (Patch)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Loading the images on the server to patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໂຫຼດ images ໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະລົງແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:34
msgid "Ensure the [path]``ptf-images.tar`` file is available on the server."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຟລ໌ [path]``ptf-images.tar`` ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:35
msgid "Load the images from the archive:"
msgstr "ໂຫຼດ images ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman load -i ptf-images.tar\n"
msgstr "podman load -i ptf-images.tar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Install the PTF using `mgradm support ptf podman` as would be done on a "
"connected machine.  Because the images are already loaded they will not be "
"pulled."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server Deployment"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you how to install and configure a {productname} "
"{productnumber} container on {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr ""

#.  Link to hardware requirements do not show them here. We list them on other pages.
#.  Done within next section.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements for {productname}"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວສຳລັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This table shows the software and hardware requirements for deploying "
"{productname} Server on your bare metal machine.  For the purposes of this "
"guide your machine should have 16 GB of RAM, and at least 200 GB of disk "
"space.  For background information about disk space, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຊອບແວ ແລະ ຮາດແວສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Server ໃນເຄື່ອງ bare metal ຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຄູ່ມືນີ້, ເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານຄວນມີ RAM 16 GB, ແລະ ເນື້ອທີ່ດິດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 200 GB. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເນື້ອທີ່ດິດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software and Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຊອບແວ ແລະ ຮາດແວ"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Software and Hardware  | Recommended\n"
"| Operating System       | {sl-micro} {microversion} or\n"
"\n"
"                           {sles} {bci-mlm}\n"
"| Architecture           | {x86_64}, {arm}, {s390x}, {ppc64le}\n"
"| Processor (CPU)        | Minimum of four (4) 64-bit CPU cores\n"
"| RAM                    | 16 GB\n"
"| Disk Space             | 200 GB\n"
"| Channel Requirements   | 50 GB per SUSE or openSUSE product\n"
"                          \n"
"                           360 GB per Red Hat product\n"
"| Swap space:            | 8 to 12 GB\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported operating system for the Server Container Host"
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Server Container Host"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The supported operating system for the container host is {sl-micro} "
"{microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:10
msgid ""
"A container host is a server equipped with a container engine like "
"[systemitem]``Podman``, which lets it manage and deploy containers.  These "
"containers hold applications and their essential parts, such as libraries, "
"but not a full operating system, making them lightweight.  This setup "
"ensures applications run the same way in different environments.  The "
"container host supplies the necessary resources such as CPU, memory, and "
"storage for these containers."
msgstr "Container host ແມ່ນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີ Container Engine ເຊັ່ນ [systemitem]``Podman``, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຈັດການ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ containers ໄດ້. containers ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ Libraries, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເອົາລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທັງໝົດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. Container host ຈະສະໜອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ CPU, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກັບ containers ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Server deployment mandates the use of a fully qualified domain name (FQDN).  "
"In the absence of automatic DNS provision of an FQDN by your router or "
"network, the deployment process will not proceed successfully.  An FQDN "
"typically follows the format <host>.<domain>.com."
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ເຊີເວີຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN). ຫາກບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດ FQDN ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຜ່ານ DNS ຈາກເຣົາເຕີ ຫຼື ເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳໃຊ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ. FQDN ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ <host>.<domain>.com."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:12
msgid "For instance:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

