#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy conversion from client"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"It assumes that the proxy host system has already been bootstrapped and "
"subscribed to the base operating system channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:29
msgid "Transfer the certificates from {productname} server host"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/proxycert.pem ./\n"
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/proxykey.pem ./\n"
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/rootca.pem ./\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `mgrpxy`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The `mgrpxy` tool must be installed from a repository matching your "
"system. Choose the appropriate repository from:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:34
msgid "https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example (for openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/openSUSE_Leap_Micro_5.5/ "
"uyuni-containerutils\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in mgrpxy\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Container Images"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/containerfile/ "
"uyuni-proxy-images\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in uyuni-proxy-httpd-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-salt-broker-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-squid-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-ssh-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-tftpd-image\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:41
msgid ""
"On transactional servers, wrap the above commands in a transactional-update "
"shell session to ensure atomicity and persistence:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update shell\n"
"# (run zypper commands here)\n"
"exit\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:43
msgid "This ensures changes are applied correctly in the transactional environment."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:60
msgid "For [literal]``Registry URL`` use: [literal]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:63
msgid ""
"For each individual container URL field, use the registry: "
"[literal]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni`` followed by the corresponding "
"suffix, for example, `_proxy-httpd_` or `_salt-broker_`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Deployment on {leapmicro} {microversion}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide outlines the deployment process for the {productname} "
"{productnumber} Proxy.  This guide presumes you have already successfully "
"deployed a {productname} {productnumber} Server.  To successfully deploy, "
"you will perform the following actions:"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ອະທິບາຍຂະບວນການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy. ຄູ່ມືນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname} {productnumber} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດຜົນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checklist: Proxy Deployment"
msgstr "ລາຍການກວດສອບ (Checklist): ການຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ"

#.  . Synchronize the {leapmicro} {microversion} parent channel and the Proxy extension child channel on the server.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid "Install {leapmicro} {microversion} on a bare-metal machine."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {leapmicro} {microversion} ໃນເຄື່ອງຈິງ (bare-metal)."

#.  . Create a {salt} activation key.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid "Bootstrap the Proxy as a {salt} minion."
msgstr "ທຳການບູດສະແຕຣບ (Bootstrap) ພຣັອກຊີໃຫ້ເປັນ {salt} minion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid "Generate a Proxy configuration."
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid "Transfer the Proxy configuration from Server to Proxy"
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີຈາກເຊີເວີໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Use the Proxy configuration to register the {salt} minion as a Proxy with "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ {salt} minion ໃຫ້ເປັນພຣັອກຊີກັບ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The supported operating system for the container host is {leapmicro} "
"{microversion}."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສແມ່ນ {leapmicro} {microversion}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"A container host is a server equipped with a container engine like Podman, "
"which lets it manage and deploy containers. These containers hold "
"applications and their essential parts, such as libraries, but not a full "
"operating system, making them lightweight. This setup ensures applications "
"run the same way in different environments. The container host supplies the "
"necessary resources such as CPU, memory, and storage for these containers."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ (container host) ແມ່ນເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງຈັກຄອນເທນເນີເຊັ່ນ Podman, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມັນຈັດການ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີໄດ້. ຄອນເທນເນີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບັນຈຸແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ ໄລບຣາຣີ (libraries), ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທັງໝົດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສຈະສະໜອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຊັ່ນ CPU, ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກັບຄອນເທນເນີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
