msgid ""
"An {leapmicro} {microversion} server should be installed from installation "
"media.  This procedure is described below."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ {leapmicro} {microversion} ຄວນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container Host Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງ Container Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For CPU, RAM, and storage requirements, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[Hardware "
"requirements]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານ CPU, RAM, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[ຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To guarantee that clients can resolve the FQDN domain name, both the "
"containerized server and the host machines must be linked to a functional "
"DNS server. Additionally, it is essential to ensure correct configuration of "
"reverse lookups."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຊອກຫາຊື່ໂດເມນ FQDN ໄດ້, ທັງເຊີເວີໃນຮູບແບບຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໂຮສ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ DNS ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ມັນຍັງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄົ້ນຫາແບບຍ້ອນກັບນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing Uyuni Tools for Use With Containers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Uyuni Tools on {leapmicro} {microversion}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມື Uyuni ໃນ {leapmicro} {microversion}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On your local host open a terminal window or start up a virtual machine "
"running {leapmicro} {microversion}."
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງເທີມິນໍ (terminal) ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນທີ່ຣັນ {leapmicro} {microversion}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:27
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid "Log in."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:28
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "Enter the [command]``transactional-update shell``:"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ [command]``transactional-update shell``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:29
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update shell\n"
msgstr "transactional-update shell\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:30
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Add the following repository to your {leapmicro} {microversion} server:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repository) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນເຊີເວີ {leapmicro} {microversion} ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Proxy-POOL-$(arch)-Media1/ "
"uyuni-proxy-stable\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:32
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "Refresh the repository list and accept the key:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊລາຍຊື່ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ ແລະ ຍອມຮັບຄີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:33
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper ref\n"
msgstr "zypper ref\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:34
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid "Install the container tools:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມືຄອນເທນເນີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in mgrpxy mgrpxy-bash-completion uyuni-storage-setup-proxy\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Alternatively you may install [systemitem]``mgrpxy-zsh-completion`` or "
"[systemitem]``mgrpxy-fish-completion``."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ [systemitem]``mgrpxy-zsh-completion`` ຫຼື [systemitem]``mgrpxy-fish-completion`` ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:37
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:26
msgid "Exit the transactional shell:"
msgstr "ອອກຈາກ transactional shell:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:38
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional update # exit\n"
msgstr "transactional update # exit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:39
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:28
msgid "Reboot the host."
msgstr "ຣີບູດເຄື່ອງໂຮສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:40
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information on the Uyuni Container Utilities, see "
"link:https://build.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:Uyuni:Stable:ContainerUtils[Uyuni "
"Container Utilities]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Uyuni Container Utilities, ເບິ່ງ link:https://build.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:Uyuni:Stable:ContainerUtils[Uyuni Container Utilities]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:42
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This step is optional.  However, if custom persistent storage is required "
"for your infrastructure, use the [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` tool."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄົງທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap the Proxy Host as a Minion"
msgstr "ບູດສະແຕຣບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສໃຫ້ເປັນ Minion"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Bootstrap the Proxy Host"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ບູດສະແຕຣບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:54
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:3
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:55
msgid "Fill in the fields for your Proxy host."
msgstr "ກອກຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆສຳລັບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:56
msgid "Select the Activation key created in the previous step from the dropdown."
msgstr "ເລືອກ Activation key ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈາກເມນູລົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:57
msgid "Click btn:[+ Bootstrap]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[+ Bootstrap]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Wait for the Bootstrap process to complete successfully.  Check the "
"menu:Salt[] menu and confirm the {salt} minion key is listed and accepted."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຂະບວນການ Bootstrap ສຳເລັດຜົນ. ກວດສອບເມນູ menu:Salt[] ແລະ ຢືນຢັນວ່າຄີຂອງ {salt} minion ຖືກສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:59
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:63
msgid "Reboot the Proxy host."
msgstr "ຣີບູດພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Select the host from the menu:System[] list and trigger a second reboot "
"after all events are finished to conclude the onboarding."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂຮສຈາກລາຍຊື່ menu:System[] ແລະ ທຳການຣີບູດຄັ້ງທີສອງຫຼັງຈາກທຸກເຫດການສຳເລັດ ເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການນຳລະບົບເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານ (onboarding)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Update the Proxy Host"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ອັບເດດພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:62
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Select the host from the menu:Systems[] list and apply all patches to update "
"it."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂຮສຈາກລາຍຊື່ menu:Systems[] ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດຊ໌ (patches) ທັງໝົດເພື່ອອັບເດດມັນ."

#.  FIXME 2024-12-10, ke: use the snippet also here (see MLM equiv)
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:65
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The configuration archive of the {productname} Proxy is generated by the "
"{productname} Server.  Each additional Proxy requires its own configuration "
"archive."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ {productname} Proxy ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍເຊີເວີ {productname}. ແຕ່ລະພຣັອກຊີທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່ ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງໃຜມັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:66
msgid ""
"The container host for the {productname} Proxy must be registered as a salt "
"minion to the {productname} Server prior to generating this Proxy "
"configuration."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນເປັນ salt minion ກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:67
msgid "You will perform the following tasks:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:69
msgid "Generate a Proxy configuration file."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:70
msgid "Transfer the configuration to the Proxy."
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:71
msgid "Start the Proxy with the [literal]``mgrpxy`` command."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Generating a Proxy Container Configuration using Web UI"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄອນເທນເນີພຣັອກຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ Web UI"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:73
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] and fill the "
"required data:"
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:74
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy FQDN`` field type fully qualified domain name for "
"the proxy."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Proxy FQDN`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນແບບເຕັມ (FQDN) ສຳລັບ proxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:75
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` field type fully qualified domain name for "
"the {productname} Server or another {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນແບບເຕັມ (FQDN) ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ຫຼື {productname} Proxy ໂຕອື່ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:76
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` field type SSH port on which SSH service "
"is listening on {productname} Proxy. Recommended is to keep default 8022."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນພອດ SSH ທີ່ບໍລິການ SSH ເປີດຮັບຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Proxy. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 8022."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:77
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` field type maximal allowed "
"size for Squid cache. Typically this should be at most 60% of available "
"storage for the containers."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບ Squid cache. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຄວນມີຂະໜາດບໍ່ເກີນ 60% ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີສຳລັບ containers."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:78
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` selection list choose if new server "
"certificate should be generated for {productname} Proxy or an existing one "
"should be used.  You can consider generated certificates as {productname} "
"builtin (self signed) certificates."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າຈະສ້າງ server certificate ໃໝ່ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຫຼື ຈະໃຊ້ certificate ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດຖືວ່າ certificate ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເປັນ certificate ພາຍໃນ (self signed) ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:79
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Depending on the choice then provide either path to signing CA certificate "
"to generate a new certificate or path to an existing certificate and its key "
"to be used as proxy certificate."
msgstr "ອີງຕາມຕົວເລືອກຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ signing CA certificate ເພື່ອສ້າງ certificate ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ certificate ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ key ຂອງມັນເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນ proxy certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:80
msgid ""
"The CA certificates generated on the server are stored in the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/ssl-build`` directory."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເຊີເວີແມ່ນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/ssl-build``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:81
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about existing or custom certificates and the concept "
"of corporate and intermediate certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ certificate ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື custom certificates ແລະ ແນວຄວາມຄິດກ່ຽວກັບ corporate ແລະ intermediate certificates, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Generate] to register new proxy FQDN in {productname} Server and "
"generate configuration archive with details for container host."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Generate] ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ proxy FQDN ໃໝ່ໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າພ້ອມລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:83
msgid ""
"After a few moments you are presented with file to download. Save this file "
"locally."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈັກພັກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫລດ. ກະລຸນາບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:84
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:85
msgid ""
"The {webui} generates a configuration archive.  This archive needs to be "
"made available on the Proxy container host."
msgstr "{webui} ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດຕຽມໄວ້ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສຂອງພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Copy the Proxy configuration"
msgstr "ວຽກ: ກັອບປີ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:87
msgid "Copy the files from the Server container to the Server host OS:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ຈາກຄອນເທນເນີເຊີເວີໄປຫາ OS ຂອງໂຮສເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:88
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl cp server:/root/config.tar.gz .\n"
msgstr "mgrctl cp server:/root/config.tar.gz .\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:89
msgid "Next copy the files from the Server host OS to the Proxy host:"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ຈາກ OS ຂອງໂຮສເຊີເວີໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:90
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "scp config.tar.gz <proxy-FQDN>:/root\n"
msgstr "scp config.tar.gz <proxy-FQDN>:/root\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:91
msgid "Install the Proxy with:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:92
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:63
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:74
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy install podman config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy install podman config.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:93
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-start-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start the {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"

