#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Legacy Proxy Migration to Container"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The containerized proxy now is managed by a set of systemd services.  For "
"managing the containerized proxy, use the [command]``mgrpxy`` tool."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section will help you migrate from the legacy [systemitem]``systemd`` "
"proxy using the [command]``mgrpxy`` tool."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"An in-place migration from previous releases of {productname} to "
"{productnumber} will remain unsupported due to the HostOS change from {leap} "
"to {leapmicro}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The traditional contact protocol is no longer supported in {productname} "
"{productnumber} and later.  Before migrating from previous {productname} "
"releases to {productnumber}, any existing traditional clients including the "
"traditional proxies must be migrated to {salt}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate From Legacy to Containerized Proxy With Systemd"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Proxy Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generate the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] from the left navigation."
msgstr "ເລືອກ menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid "Enter your Proxy FQDN. Use the same FQDN as the original proxy host."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ FQDN ຂອງພຣັອກຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ FQDN ດຽວກັນກັບພຣັອກຊີໂຮສເດີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Enter your Server FQDN."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Enter the Proxy port number. __We recommend using the default port of "
"8022.__"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Certificate and private key are located on the Server container host in "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build/`."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ private key ແມ່ນຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນໂຮສຂອງຄອນເທນເນີເຊີເວີ ທີ່ `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT"
msgstr "RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid "RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY"
msgstr "RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid "Copy the certificate and key to your machine with:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ຄີໄປຫາເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scp root@uyuni-server-example.com:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY "
".\n"
"scp root@uyuni-server-example.com:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT "
".\n"
msgstr ""
"scp root@uyuni-server-example.com:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY .\n"
"scp root@uyuni-server-example.com:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT .\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid "Select btn:[Choose File] and browse your local machine for the certificate."
msgstr "ເລືອກ btn:[Choose File] ແລະ ເລືອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Select btn:[Choose File] and brose your local machine for the private key."
msgstr "ເລືອກ btn:[Choose File] ແລະ ເລືອກ private key ຈາກເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid "Enter the CA password."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ CA."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Generate]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Generate]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer Proxy Configuration to New Host"
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີໄປຫາໂຮສໃໝ່"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Transfering the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid ""
"From the Server transfer the generated tar.gz file containing the proxy "
"configuration to the new Proxy host:"
msgstr "ຈາກເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ tar.gz ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ ໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຮສໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "scp config.tar.gz <uyuni-proxy-FQDN>:/root/\n"
msgstr "scp config.tar.gz <uyuni-proxy-FQDN>:/root/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:27
msgid "Disable the legacy proxy prior to executing the next step:"
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານພຣັອກຊີແບບເກົ່າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-proxy stop\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-proxy stop\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:29
msgid "Deploy the new Proxy with:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr "systemctl start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:31
msgid "Enable the new Proxy with:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now uyuni-proxy-pod\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:33
msgid "Run `podman ps` to verify all the containers are present and running:"
msgstr "ຣັນ `podman ps` ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າຄອນເທນເນີທັງໝົດມີຢູ່ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"proxy-salt-broker\n"
"proxy-httpd\n"
"proxy-tftpd\n"
"proxy-squid\n"
"proxy-ssh\n"
msgstr ""
"proxy-salt-broker\n"
"proxy-httpd\n"
"proxy-tftpd\n"
"proxy-squid\n"
"proxy-ssh\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Migrate {productname} Proxy to {productname} {productnumber} Containerized "
"Proxy"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍ {productname} Proxy ໄປຫາ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Migrate {productname} Containerized Proxy to {productname} "
"{productnumber} New Containerized Proxy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:37
msgid "Boot your new machine and begin installation of {leapmicro} {microversion}."
msgstr "ບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {leapmicro} {microversion}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:38
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:23
msgid "Complete the installation."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update --continue\n"
msgstr "transactional-update --continue\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Install [command]``mgrpxy`` and optionally, "
"[command]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ [command]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ ທາງເລືອກ [command]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update pkg install mgrpxy mgrpxy-bash-completion \n"
msgstr "transactional-update pkg install mgrpxy mgrpxy-bash-completion \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:44
msgid "Copy your [literal]``tar.gz`` proxy configuration to the host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Packages Using the {webui}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:46
msgid ""
"The [package]``mgrpxy`` and [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion`` packages can "
"also be installed via the web UI after the minion has been bootstrapped and "
"registered with the Server."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ [package]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion`` ກໍສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ web UI ໄດ້ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ minion ໄດ້ຮັບການບູດສະແຕຣບ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Packages Using the {webui}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:48
msgid ""
"After installation, ensure that the {sle-micro} {microversion} parent "
"channel and Proxy child channels are added and synchronized from the "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard -> Products] page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, go to menu:Systems[Activation Keys] and create an activation "
"key linked for the synchronized {sle-micro} {microversion} channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Bootstrap your system as a minion using the menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] "
"page."
msgstr "ບູດສະແຕຣບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນ minion ໂດຍໃຊ້ໜ້າ menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Once the new machine is onboarded and displayed in the systems list, select "
"the system and navigate to the menu:System Details[Install Package] page."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ ແລະ ສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ລະບົບແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລະບົບນັ້ນ ແລະ ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ menu:System Details[Install Package]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Install the packages [package]``mgrpxy`` and "
"[package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ [package]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:53
msgid "Reboot the system."
msgstr "ຣີບູດລະບົບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Proxy Config With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:55
msgid "You can generate a Proxy configuration using spacecmd."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ spacecmd."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generate Proxy Config With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Self-Signed "
"Certificate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:57
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:23
msgid "SSH into your container host."
msgstr "SSH ເຂົ້າໄປໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:58
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:69
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:24
msgid "Execute the following command replacing the Server and Proxy FQDN:"
msgstr "ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ໂດຍແທນບ່ອນ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:59
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config_generate_cert -- "
"dev-pxy.example.com dev-srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com -o "
"/tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config_generate_cert -- dev-pxy.example.com dev-srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:60
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:71
msgid "Copy the generated config to the Proxy:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:61
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:72
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:27
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl cp server:/tmp/config.tar.gz .\n"
msgstr "mgrctl cp server:/tmp/config.tar.gz .\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:62
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:73
msgid "Deploy the Proxy with:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Proxy Config With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Custom Certificate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:65
msgid ""
"You can generate Proxy configuration using [literal]``spacecmd`` for a "
"custom certificates rather than default self-signed certificates."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:66
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:13
msgid ""
"2 GB represents the default proxy squid cache size.  This will need to be "
"adjusted for your environment."
msgstr "2 GB ແມ່ນຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ proxy squid cache. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generate Proxy Config With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Custom "
"Certificate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:68
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:31
msgid "SSH into your Server container host."
msgstr "SSH ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໂຮສຂອງຄອນເທນເນີເຊີເວີ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:70
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for f in ca.crt proxy.crt proxy.key; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp/$f\n"
"done\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 pxy.example.com "
"srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt "
"/tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr ""
"for f in ca.crt proxy.crt proxy.key; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp/$f\n"
"done\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is Air-gapped Deployment?"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແບບແຍກສ່ວນ (Air-gapped) ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Air-gapped deployment refers to the setup and operation of any networked "
"system that is physically isolated from insecure networks, especially the "
"internet. This type of deployment is commonly used in high-security "
"environments such as military installations, financial systems, critical "
"infrastructure, and anywhere sensitive data is handled and must be protected "
"from external threats."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ Air-gapped ໝາຍເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລະບົບເຄືອຂ່າຍໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຖືກແຍກອອກທາງກາຍະພາບຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພ, ໂດຍສະເພາະອິນເຕີເນັດ. ການຕິດຕັ້ງປະເພດນີ້ມັກຖືກໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພສູງ ເຊັ່ນ: ສະຖານທີ່ທາງທະຫານ, ລະບົບການເງິນ, ໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຳຄັນ, ແລະ ບ່ອນໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມີການຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປົກປ້ອງຈາກໄພຄຸກຄາມພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can easily deploy container images using [systemitem]``Podman``, "
"[systemitem]``Docker``, or [systemitem]``Skopeo`` on a machine with internet "
"access."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງຮູບພາບຄອນເທນເນີໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ [systemitem]``Podman``, [systemitem]``Docker``, ຫຼື [systemitem]``Skopeo`` ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Pull the desired image, then save the image as a [literal]``tar`` archive.  "
"For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Podman"
msgstr "Podman"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman pull registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest\n"
"podman save --output server.tar registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"docker pull registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest\n"
"docker save --output server.tar registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Skopeo"
msgstr "Skopeo"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"skopeo copy docker://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest "
"docker-archive:server.tar:registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Transfer the resulting [filename]``server-image.tar`` to the Server "
"container host and load it using the following command:"
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ [filename]``server-image.tar`` ທີ່ໄດ້ໄປຫາໂຮສຂອງຄອນເທນເນີເຊີເວີ ແລະ ໂຫຼດມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Load the server image"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman load -i server.tar\n"
msgstr "podman load -i server.tar\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy {productname} on {leapmicro}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{productname} also provides all the needed container images in RPM packages "
"that can be installed on the system."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"User should make the needed RPM available on the internal network. That can "
"be done by using a second {productname} Server or any kind of mirror."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Install {productname} on {leapmicro} in Air-gapped"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Install {leapmicro}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Install tools packages and image packages (replace $ARCH$ with the correct "
"architecture):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update pkg install mgradm* mgrctl* uyuni-server*-image*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Deploy {productname} with [command]``mgradm``. In an Air-gapped environment "
"you may want to use the option [command]``--pullPolicy Never``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more detailed information about installing {productname} Server on "
"{leapmicro}, see "
"xref:container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc[Server "
"Deployment]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server Deployment on {leapmicro} {microversion}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment Preparations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In this section, you will gain expertise in setting up and deploying a "
"{productname} Server.  The process encompasses the installation of "
"[command]``Podman``, [systemitem]``Uyuni container utilities``, deployment, "
"and then initiating interaction with the container through "
"[command]``mgrctl``."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນນີ້, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname}. ຂະບວນການດັ່ງກ່າວປະກອບມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ [command]``Podman``, [systemitem]``Uyuni container utilities``, ການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບ, ແລະ ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບຄອນເທນເນີຜ່ານ [command]``mgrctl``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This section assumes you have already configured an {leapmicro} "
"{microversion} host server, whether it is running on a physical machine or "
"within a virtual environment."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຮສເຊີເວີ {leapmicro} {microversion} ແລ້ວ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຣັນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງຈິງ ຫຼື ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສະເໝືອນກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "https://download.opensuse.org/distribution/leap-micro/"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"An {leapmicro} {microversion} server should be installed from installation "
"media."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "This procedure is described below."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing Uyuni Tools For Use With Containers"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-$(arch)-Media1/ "
"uyuni-server-stable\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper in mgradm mgrctl mgradm-bash-completion mgrctl-bash-completion "
"uyuni-storage-setup-server\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:38
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying an Uyuni Container With Podman"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "[command]``mgradm`` Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:41
msgid ""
"{productname} is deployed as a container using the [command]``mgradm`` "
"tool.  There are two methods of deploying a {productname} server as a "
"container.  In this section we will focus on basic container deployment."
msgstr "{productname} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງເປັນຄອນເທນເນີໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm``. ມີສອງວິທີໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີ {productname} ເປັນຄອນເທນເນີ. ໃນສ່ວນນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີຂັ້ນພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For information on using a custom configuration file to deploy, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For additional information, you can explore further by running "
"[command]``mgradm --help`` from the command line."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ທ່ານສາມາດສຶກສາໄດ້ໂດຍການຣັນ [command]``mgradm --help`` ຈາກຄອມມານລາຍ (command line)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying an Uyuni container with Podman"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີ Uyuni ດ້ວຍ Podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:45
msgid "From the terminal run the following command as the sudo user or as root."
msgstr "ຈາກເທີມິນໍ, ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ sudo ຫຼື root."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo mgradm install podman\n"
msgstr "sudo mgradm install podman\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:47
msgid ""
"You must deploy the container as sudo or root. The following error will be "
"displayed at the terminal if you miss this step."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີໃນນາມ sudo ຫຼື root. ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນທີ່ເທີມິນໍ ຫາກທ່ານຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:48
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"INF Setting up uyuni network\n"
"9:58AM INF Enabling system service\n"
"9:58AM FTL Failed to open /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service for "
"writing error=\"open /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service: permission "
"denied\"\n"
msgstr ""
"INF Setting up uyuni network\n"
"9:58AM INF Enabling system service\n"
"9:58AM FTL Failed to open /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service for writing error=\"open /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service: permission denied\"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:52
msgid "Many users will want to specify locations for their persistent volumes."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຄົນອາດຈະຕ້ອງການລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງສຳລັບວໍລຸມແບບຄົງທີ່ຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:53
msgid ""
"If you are just testing out {productname} you do not need to specify these "
"volumes.  [command]``mgradm`` will setup the correct volumes by default."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Specifying volume locations will generally be used for larger production "
"deployments."
msgstr "ການລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງວໍລຸມ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບການຜະລິດ (production) ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:55
msgid ""
"By default [command]``podman`` stores its volumes in "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [command]``podman`` ຈະເກັບວໍລຸມຂອງມັນໄວ້ໃນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:56
msgid ""
"You can provide custom storage for the volumes by mounting disks on this "
"path or the expected volume path inside it such as: "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk``.  This is "
"especially important for the database and package mirrors."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:57
msgid "For a list of all persistent volumes in the container, see:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/containers.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Containers used by {productname}"
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
