#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` are "
"helper scripts provided with {productname} 5.0 and later."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ແມ່ນສະຄຣິບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ {productname} 5.0 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` are "
"helper scripts provided with {productname}."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ແມ່ນສະຄຣິບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:4
msgid "They are designed to configure storage for {productname} Server and Proxy."
msgstr "ພວກມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The scripts take disk devices as arguments.  [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` "
"requires a single argument for the storage disk device.  "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` requires a storage disk device and can "
"optionally accept a second argument for a dedicated database disk device.  "
"While both normal and database storage can reside on the same disk, it is "
"advisable to place the database on a dedicated, high-performance disk to "
"ensure better performance and easier management."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຮັບຄ່າອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ເປັນອາກິວເມັນ (arguments). [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຕ້ອງການອາກິວເມັນດຽວສຳລັບອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ຕ້ອງການອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ສາມາດຮັບອາກິວເມັນທີສອງສຳລັບອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍສະເພາະ. ເຖິງວ່າທັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດຢູ່ເທິງດິສກ໌ດຽວກັນໄດ້, ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ແຍກຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງໂດຍສະເພາະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ ແລະ ການຈັດການທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "What these tools do"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດຫຍັງແດ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Both [command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` "
"perform standard storage setup operations:"
msgstr "ທັງ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຈະປະຕິບັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:8
msgid "Validate the provided storage devices."
msgstr "ກວດສອບອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:9
msgid "Ensure that devices are empty and suitable for use."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອຸປະກອນນັ້ນວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ເໝາະສົມແກ່ການໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:10
msgid "Create XFS filesystems on the specified devices."
msgstr "ສ້າງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS ໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:11
msgid "Mount the devices temporarily for data migration."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ (Mount) ອຸປະກອນໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:12
msgid "Move the relevant storage directories to the new devices."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Create entries in [path]``/etc/fstab`` so that the storage mounts "
"automatically on boot."
msgstr "ສ້າງລາຍການໃນ [path]``/etc/fstab`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ວໍລຸມຖືກເມົາທ໌ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເປີດເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:14
msgid "Remount the devices at their final locations."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ອຸປະກອນຄືນໃໝ່ໃນສະຖານທີ່ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional tool-specific behavior"
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳເພີ່ມເຕີມສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງມື"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `mgr-storage-server`\n"
"| \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optionally supports a separate device for database storage.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stops SUSE Manager services during migration, restarts them afterward.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Moves Podman volumes directory [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` "
"to the prepared storage, and optionally "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` to the prepared "
"database storage.\n"
"\n"
"| `mgr-storage-proxy`\n"
"|\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Focuses only on proxy storage (no database storage support).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stops and restarts the proxy service during migration.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Moves podman volumes directory [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` "
"to the prepared storage.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Both tools automate standard Linux storage operations.  There is no hidden "
"or custom logic beyond what a Linux administrator would do manually."
msgstr "ທັງສອງເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ບໍ່ມີເຫດຜົນທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ ຫຼື ແບບພິເສດນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກສິ່ງທີ່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ Linux ຈະເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "What these tools do *not* do"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ເຮັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:25
msgid "They do *not* create or manage LVM volumes."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ສ້າງ ຫຼື ຈັດການວໍລຸມ LVM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:26
msgid "They do *not* configure RAID or complex storage topologies."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ຕັ້ງຄ່າ RAID ຫຼື ໂຄງສ້າງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:27
msgid ""
"They do *not* prevent you from managing storage using normal Linux tools "
"after setup."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ຂັດຂວາງເຈົ້າຈາກການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື Linux ທົ່ວໄປຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:28
msgid ""
"They do *not* provide dynamic resizing or expansion capabilities — these "
"must be handled using standard Linux storage tools."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍແບບໄດນາມິກ — ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຈັດການດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-installation storage management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັງການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Once storage has been configured, you can safely manage it using standard "
"Linux commands."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈັດການມັນໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 1: Extending storage if using LVM"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ 1: ການຂະຫຍາຍບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖ້າໃຊ້ LVM"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lvextend -L +10G /dev/your_vg/your_lv\n"
"xfs_growfs /var/lib/containers/storage/volumes\n"
msgstr ""
"lvextend -L +10G /dev/your_vg/your_lv\n"
"xfs_growfs /var/lib/containers/storage/volumes\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2: Migrating to a larger disk "
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ 2: ການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງດິສກ໌ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:35
msgid "Add and format the new disk."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຟໍແມັດດິສກ໌ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:36
msgid "Mount it temporarily."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ມັນໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:37
msgid "Use `rsync` to copy data."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `rsync` ເພື່ອກ່າຍຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:38
msgid "Update `/etc/fstab`."
msgstr "ອັບເດດ `/etc/fstab`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:39
msgid "Remount at the correct location."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ຄືນໃໝ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "When to use, or not use"
msgstr "ຄວນໃຊ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:41
msgid "Always take a backup before making changes to your storage setup."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນສະເໝີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Use these tools *only* during initial storage setup or when migrating to new "
"storage where the tool is expected to handle data migration and update "
"`/etc/fstab`."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ *ສະເພາະ* ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ເມື່ອຍ້າຍໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງເຄື່ອງມືຈະຊ່ວຍຈັດການການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ອັບເດດ `/etc/fstab` ໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Do *not* rerun these scripts for resizing or expanding storage. Use standard "
"Linux tools (e.g., [literal]``lvextend``, [literal]``xfs_growfs``) for such "
"operations."
msgstr "*ຫ້າມ* ລັນສະຄຣິບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ້ຳເພື່ອການປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux (ເຊັ່ນ: [literal]``lvextend``, [literal]``xfs_growfs``) ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "ບົດສະຫຼຸບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:45
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` help "
"automate the initial persistent storage setup for {productname} components "
"using standard Linux storage practices.  They do not limit or interfere with "
"standard storage management afterward."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບອົງປະກອບຂອງ {productname} ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳກັດ ຫຼື ແຊກແຊງການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:46
msgid "After setup, continue managing your storage using familiar Linux tools."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານຕໍ່ໄປໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Linux ທີ່ທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:47
msgid ""
"A full database volume can cause significant issues with system operation.  "
"As disk usage notifications have not yet been adapted for containerized "
"environments, users are encouraged to monitor the disk space used by Podman "
"volumes themselves, either through tools such as Grafana, Prometheus, or any "
"other preferred method.  Pay particular attention to the var-pgsql volume, "
"located under [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:2
