msgstr "ເຊິ່ງແບ່ງອອກເປັນພາກສ່ວນຕ່າງໆດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Requirements:** Outlines the essential hardware, software, and networking "
"prerequisites to ensure a smooth setup.\n"
msgstr "**ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ:** ລະບຸຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ, ຊອບແວ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນໄປຢ່າງຮາບລື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Deployment and Installation:** Guides you through deploying {productname} "
"as a container and completing the initial configuration.\n"
msgstr "**ການນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງ:** ແນະນຳຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Upgrade and Migration:** Details the process for upgrading and migrating "
"{productname} while minimizing downtime.\n"
msgstr "**ການອັບເກຣດ ແລະ ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ:** ລາຍລະອຽດຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເກຣດ ແລະ ການຍ້າຍ {productname} ໂດຍໃຫ້ລະບົບຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:22
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Basic Server Management:** Covers fundamental server operations, helping "
"you get started with {productname} efficiently. \n"
msgstr "**ການຈັດການເຊີເວີຂັ້ນພື້ນຖານ:** ກວມເອົາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເຊີເວີເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຊ້ {productname} ໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ. \n"

