#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] and fill the "
"required data."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] ແລະ ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` field type maximal allowed "
"size for Squid cache.  Recommended is to use at most 80% of available "
"storage for the containers."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບ Squid cache. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ເກີນ 80% ຂອງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The CA certificates generated by the server are stored in the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍເຊີເວີຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເລັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Generate] to register a new proxy FQDN in the {productname} "
"Server and generate a configuration archive ([filename]``config.tar.gz``) "
"containing details for the container host."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[ສ້າງ (Generate)] ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ FQDN ຂອງ proxy ໃໝ່ໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ([filename]``config.tar.gz``) ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:19
msgid ""
"After a few moments you are presented with file to download.  Save this file "
"locally."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈັກຄາວ ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດ. ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງ."

