msgid ""
"If your setup uses an intermediate CA, copy it as well and include it in the "
"command with the `-i` option (can be provided multiple times if needed) :"
msgstr "ຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ intermediate CA, ໃຫ້ສຳເນົາມັນນຳ ແລະ ລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ `-i` (ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງຫາກຈຳເປັນ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp intermediateCA.pem server:/tmp/intermediateCA.pem\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 -i "
"/tmp/intermediateCA.pem pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 "
"email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o "
"/tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp intermediateCA.pem server:/tmp/intermediateCA.pem\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 -i /tmp/intermediateCA.pem pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"

#.  end::generate-proxy-config-section[]
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-hardened-tmpdir.adoc:1
msgid ""
"{productname} server hosts that are hardened for security may restrict "
"execution of files from the [path]``/tmp`` folder.  In such cases, as a "
"workaround, export the [literal]``TMPDIR`` environment variable to another "
"existing path before running [command]``mgradm``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-hardened-tmpdir.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "export TMPDIR=/path/to/other/tmp\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-hardened-tmpdir.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In {productname} updates, tools will be changed to make this workaround "
"unnecessary."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-note-deploy-certs.adoc:1
msgid ""
"If you want to use third-party SSL certificates instead of the self-signed "
"certificates, import them in the run of the following deployment procedure."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-note-deploy-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For more information about the requirements of third-party SSL certificates, "
"see xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {sl-micro} {microversion} Host"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the installation media"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Downloading the installation media"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Locate the {sl-micro} {microversion} installation media at "
"https://www.suse.com/download/sle-micro/, and download the appropriate media "
"file."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Prepare a DVD or USB flash drive with the downloaded [filename]``.iso`` "
"image for installation."
msgstr "ກຽມແຜ່ນ DVD ຫຼື USB flash drive ດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ [filename]``.iso`` ທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {sl-micro} {microversion}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about preparing your machines (virtual or physical), "
"see the link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.1[{sl-micro} "
"Deployment Guide]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing {sl-micro} {microversion}"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Insert the DVD or USB flash drive (USB disk or key) containing the "
"installation image for {sle-micro} {microversion}."
msgstr "ສຽບແຜ່ນ DVD ຫຼື USB flash drive ທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບ {sle-micro} {microversion}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:10
msgid "Boot or reboot your system."
msgstr "ບູດ ຫຼື ຣີບູດລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:11
msgid "Use the arrow keys to select [systemitem]``Installation``."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນເພື່ອເລືອກ [systemitem]``Installation``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:12
msgid "Adjust Keyboard and language."
msgstr "ປັບປ່ຽນຄີບອດ ແລະ ພາສາ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:13
msgid "Click the [systemitem]``checkbox`` to accept the license agreement."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ [systemitem]``checkbox`` ເພື່ອຍອມຮັບຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:23
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:25
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:20
msgid "Click [systemitem]``Next`` to continue."
msgstr "ຄລິກ [systemitem]``Next`` ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Select the registration method.  For this example, we will register the "
"server with {scclongform}."
msgstr "ເລືອກວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີກັບ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The {productname} {productnumber} containers are installed as extensions.  "
"Depending on the specific extension needed from the list below, additional "
"{scclongform} registration codes will be required for each."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີຂອງ {productname} {productnumber} ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງເປັນສ່ວນເສີມ (Extensions). ຂຶ້ນກັບສ່ວນເສີມສະເພາະທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈາກລາຍຊື່ລຸ່ມນີ້, ຈະຕ້ອງມີລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {scclongform} ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:17
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server"
msgstr "{productname} {productnumber} Server"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:18
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "{productname} {productnumber} Proxy"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:19
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Retail Branch Server"
msgstr "{productname} {productnumber} Retail Branch Server"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:12
msgid "Enter your {scclongform} email address."
msgstr "ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລ {scclongform} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:22
msgid "Enter your registration code for {sl-micro} {microversion}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To install a proxy, select the {productname} {productnumber} Proxy "
"extension; to install a server, select the {productname} {productnumber} "
"Server extension ``Checkbox``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ proxy, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy; ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ server, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:21
msgid "Enter your {productname} {productnumber} extension registration code."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:27
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:28
msgid "On the [systemitem]``NTP Configuration`` page click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [systemitem]``NTP Configuration`` ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:29
msgid ""
"On the [systemitem]``Authentication for the System`` page enter a password "
"for the root user.  Click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [systemitem]``Authentication for the System`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ root user. ກົດ btn:[ຖັດໄປ]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:30
msgid "On the [systemitem]``Installation Settings`` page click btn:[Install]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [systemitem]``Installation Settings`` ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Install]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:31
msgid ""
"This concludes installation of {sl-micro} {microversion} and {productname} "
"{productnumber} as an extension."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:32
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL: Registration from the command line"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ການລົງທະບຽນຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ (Command line)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:33
msgid ""
"If you added {productname} {productnumber} as an extension during {sl-micro} "
"{microversion} installation then you can skip this procedure.  However, "
"optionally you may skip registration during {sl-micro} {microversion} "
"installation by selecting the btn:[Skip Registration] button.  This section "
"provides steps on registering your products after {sl-micro} {microversion} "
"installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The following steps register a {productname} {productnumber} extension with "
"the {x86_64} architecture and thus require a registration code for the "
"{x86_64} architecture.  To register {arm} or {s390x} architectures use the "
"correct registration code."
msgstr "ບາດກ້າວຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນການລົງທະບຽນສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} ດ້ວຍສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64} ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64}. ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {arm} ຫຼື {s390x} ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:35
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering from the command line"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:36
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:34
msgid "List available extensions with the following command:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ມີຢູ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update --quiet register --list-extensions\n"
msgstr "transactional-update --quiet register --list-extensions\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:38
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:36
msgid "From the list of available extensions, select the one you wish to install:"
msgstr "ຈາກລາຍຊື່ສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:39
msgid ""
"If installing the Server, use your {productname} Server Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code with following command:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Server Extension {productnumber} x86_64 ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Server/5.1/x86_64 -r "
"<reg_code>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:41
msgid ""
"If installing the Proxy, use your {productname} Proxy Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code with following command:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy Extension {productnumber} x86_64 ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy/5.1/x86_64 -r "
"<reg_code>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the system"
msgstr "ອັບເດດລະບົບ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating the system"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:46
msgid "Log in as *root*."
msgstr "ລັອກອິນເຂົ້າໃນຖານະ *root*."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:47
msgid "Run **transactional-update**:"
msgstr "ຣັນ **transactional-update**:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:50
msgid ""
"{sl-micro} is designed to update itself automatically by default and will "
"reboot after applying updates.  However, this behavior is not desirable for "
"the {productname} environment.  To prevent automatic updates on your server, "
"{productname} disables the transactional-update timer during the bootstrap "
"process."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:51
msgid ""
"If you prefer the {sl-micro} default behavior, enable the timer by running "
"the following command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now transactional-update.timer\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now transactional-update.timer\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {sles} {bci-mlm} host"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:2
msgid "Alternatively, you can deploy {productname} on {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The following procedures describe the main steps of the installation "
"process."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} extensions on {sles}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing {productname} Extensions on {sles}"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Locate and download {sles} {bci-mlm} [literal]``.iso`` at "
"https://www.suse.com/download/sles/."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Make sure that you have regsistration codes both for the host operating "
"system ({sles} {bci-mlm}) and extensions"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:8
msgid "Start the installation of {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:9
msgid ""
"On the [literal]``Language, keyboard and product selection`` select the "
"product to install."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [literal]``Language, keyboard and product selection`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On the [literal]``License agreement`` read the agreement and check "
"[guimenu]``I Agree to the License Terms``."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [literal]``License agreement`` ໃຫ້ອ່ານຂໍ້ຕົກລົງ ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ [guimenu]``I Agree to the License Terms``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Select the registration method. For this example, we will register the "
"server with SUSE Customer Center."
msgstr "ເລືອກວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີກັບ SUSE Customer Center."

#. type: delimited block _
