#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Select the {productname} Server Extension to install the Server, or the "
"{productname} Proxy Extension to install the Proxy."
msgstr "ເລືອກ {productname} Server Extension ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Server, ຫຼື {productname} Proxy Extension ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:18
msgid "Basesystem Module"
msgstr "Basesystem Module"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:19
msgid "Containers Module"
msgstr "Containers Module"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:24
msgid ""
"When the installation completes, log in to the newly installed server as "
"root."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັອກອິນເຂົ້າໃນເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ໃນຖານະ root."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Update the System (optional, if the system was not set to download updates "
"during install):"
msgstr "ອັບເດດລະບົບ (ທາງເລືອກ, ຫາກລະບົບບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດການອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ):"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:29
msgid ""
"If you added {productname} {productnumber} as an extension during {sles} "
"installation then you can skip this procedure."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:30
msgid ""
"However, optionally you may skip registration during {sles} installation by "
"selecting the btn:[Skip Registration] button.  This section provides steps "
"on registering your products after {sles} installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The following steps register a {productname} {productnumber} extension with "
"the {x86_64} architecture and thus require a registration code for the "
"{x86_64} architecture."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:32
msgid ""
"To register {arm} or {s390x} architectures use the correct registration "
"code."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect --list-extensions\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect --list-extensions\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:37
msgid ""
"If installing the Server, use your {productname} Server Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code.  For example for {sle} 15 SP7, use "
"the following commands:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SUSEConnect -r <regcode>\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-containers/15.7/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Server-SLE/5.1/x86_64 -r <regcode>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:39
msgid ""
"If installing the Proxy, use your {productname} Proxy Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code with the following command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy-SLE/5.1/x86_64 -r <regcode>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install and enable [package]``podman``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing [package]``podman``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:43
msgid "Log in as root and install the product package."
msgstr "ລັອກອິນໃນຖານະ root ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:44
msgid "On the server:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product SUSE-Multi-Linux-Manager-Server\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:46
msgid "On the proxies:"
msgstr "ໃນ proxies:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product SUSE-Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Make sure that package [package]``podman`` is installed.  Additionally, on "
"the server [package]``mgradm`` and [package]``mgradm-bash-completion`` or on "
"the proxies, [package]``mgrpxy`` and [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion`` "
"also need to be installed."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``podman`` ແລ້ວ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນເຊີເວີ [package]``mgradm`` ແລະ [package]``mgradm-bash-completion`` ຫຼື ໃນ proxies, [package]``mgrpxy`` ແລະ [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion`` ກໍຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:49
msgid "Start the Podman service by rebooting the system, or running a command:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ Podman ໂດຍການຣີບູດລະບົບ, ຫຼື ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now podman.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now podman.service\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register {sl-micro} and {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr ""

#.  Before starting obtain your SUSE Manager Registration Code from SUSE Customer Center - https://scc.suse.com.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering {sl-micro} and {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:8
msgid "Register {productname} {productnumber} Proxy with {scclongform}."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {productname} {productnumber} Proxy ກັບ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy/5.1/x86_64 -r "
"<REGCODE>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``.  This tool "
"simplifies creating the container volumes."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``. ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງ container volumes ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This command will move the persistent storage volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` to the specified storage "
"device."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະຍ້າຍ persistent storage volumes ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:1
msgid ""
"SSL certificates are needed at a later stage.  If not using the self-signed "
"generated CA and certificates, ensure you have the following before "
"starting:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A certificate authority (CA) SSL public certificate.  If you are using a CA "
"chain, all intermediate CAs must also be available."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "An SSL database private key."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "An SSL database certificate."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "All files must be in PEM format."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL server certificate must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on.  You can set the hostnames in "
"the [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` section of the "
"certificate.  You can also list multiple hostnames if your environment "
"requires it.  Supported Key types are [literal]``RSA`` and [literal]``EC`` "
"(Elliptic Curve)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Database SSL certificate requires [literal]``reportdb`` and [literal]``db`` "
"and the FQDN used to access the report database as [literal]``Subject "
"Alternative Name``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-start-proxy.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Start and Check Proxy Status"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ກວດສອບສະຖານະ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:1
msgid "Deploy {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you use VM images as a migration target, here as the last step, execute "
"the command [command]``mgradm migrate`` instead of [command]``mgradm "
"install``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Execute one of the following commands, depending on the SSL certificate "
"variant (self-signed or third-party).\n"
"  Replace `<FQDN>` with your fully qualified domain name of the "
"{productname} Server:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:4
msgid "Using self-signed certificates provided by {productname}:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"With importing SSL certificates using third-party SSL certificate flags (the "
"example can adjusted if not all these certificates are needed):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman <FQDN> \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-intermediate <strings> \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-root <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-cert <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-key <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-ca-intermediate <strings> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-ca-root <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-cert <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-key <string>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:8
msgid "For more information, see [command]``mgradm install podman --help``."
msgstr ""

